      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=3)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
